  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7500401",
      "subQuestName": "Check the hole below",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750040101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750040101": {
            "id": "750040101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Why's there a stone tablet here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040102"
            ]
          },
          "750040102": {
            "id": "750040102",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "It might have been left by tribesfolk of the past. That happens quite often around here. Long ago, this was a boundary marker, telling you that \"you've crossed the line!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040103"
            ]
          },
          "750040103": {
            "id": "750040103",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "You can sometimes find stones with patterns carved in white on them throughout our lands that serve the same purpose. They've just all been abandoned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040104"
            ]
          },
          "750040104": {
            "id": "750040104",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040105"
            ]
          },
          "750040105": {
            "id": "750040105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's what's happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040106"
            ]
          },
          "750040106": {
            "id": "750040106",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Boundaries and borders are no laughing matter here... Between the living and the dead, within and without, above and below... Only those who have crossed these lines can grasp the dangers they face.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040107"
            ]
          },
          "750040107": {
            "id": "750040107",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "It is said that there was once a stone tablet in an ancient ruin that read thus: \"If any tread past this stone with ill-intent, mine hand shall drake-claw become, and grasp their neck shall I.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040108"
            ]
          },
          "750040108": {
            "id": "750040108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err, wait. What if this stone tablet has some sort of warning or curse on it, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040109"
            ]
          },
          "750040109": {
            "id": "750040109",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I can tell at a glance... Traore left this here. To think that... *sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040111"
            ]
          },
          "750040111": {
            "id": "750040111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He's from the story you told us before, right, Titu? When the Abyss was corrupting Natlan, he led the tribesfolk against them... and against two soldiers from Khaenri'ah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040113"
            ]
          },
          "750040113": {
            "id": "750040113",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040114"
            ]
          },
          "750040114": {
            "id": "750040114",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Haha, you're quite the avid listeners. Storytellers love people like you, y'know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040115"
            ]
          },
          "750040115": {
            "id": "750040115",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "After all, the capacity to remember such tales is a basic quality that all storytellers must have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040116"
            ]
          },
          "750040116": {
            "id": "750040116",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Let me see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040117"
            ]
          },
          "750040117": {
            "id": "750040117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It says, friends from afar... \"Zephaniah and Irizar.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040118"
            ]
          },
          "750040118": {
            "id": "750040118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... \"You would prefer to be known as cowards, rogues, or a thorn in our side — that you should ever increase our vigilance, like an aphid that bites a Saurian.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040119"
            ]
          },
          "750040119": {
            "id": "750040119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Yet I must speak the truth here. Forever and always shall you be heroes who fought alongside our tribe, the brother-kin of the Children of Echoes.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040120"
            ]
          },
          "750040120": {
            "id": "750040120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, wait, so those Khaenri'ahns fought alongside the tribe, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040121"
            ]
          },
          "750040121": {
            "id": "750040121",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Well... The names of those two have always featured in stories as the embodiment... of evil. They've even appeared in my nightmares.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040122"
            ]
          },
          "750040122": {
            "id": "750040122",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "\"If you don't stop crying, the ghosts of the Khaenri'ahn soldiers will follow the sound and track down your shadow...\" So they said. But... it was all a lie?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040123"
            ]
          },
          "750040123": {
            "id": "750040123",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Such injustice... that those who gave their all for our tribe should bear such slander.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040124"
            ]
          },
          "750040124": {
            "id": "750040124",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, that's... so sad.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040125"
            ]
          },
          "750040125": {
            "id": "750040125",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Oroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040126"
            ]
          },
          "750040126": {
            "id": "750040126",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They did not care for their good name...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040127"
            ]
          },
          "750040127": {
            "id": "750040127",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They only wished to see their will fulfilled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040128"
            ]
          },
          "750040128": {
            "id": "750040128",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's how it is... Paimon gets it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040129"
            ]
          },
          "750040129": {
            "id": "750040129",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Most heroes don't do great deeds to become heroes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040130"
            ]
          },
          "750040130": {
            "id": "750040130",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They become heroes because they do those deeds. That's why they don't care about what others think of them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040131"
            ]
          },
          "750040131": {
            "id": "750040131",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040132"
            ]
          },
          "750040132": {
            "id": "750040132",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "*sigh* Perhaps you're right, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040133"
            ]
          },
          "750040133": {
            "id": "750040133",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, there the Iridescent Inscription goes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040134"
            ]
          },
          "750040134": {
            "id": "750040134",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Wow, so this... This must've been where they finally sealed the Abyss. Look, {NICKNAME}, there are so many golden patterns in the middle there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040135"
            ]
          },
          "750040135": {
            "id": "750040135",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can also see traces of Abyss leakage here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040136"
            ]
          },
          "750040136": {
            "id": "750040136",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Looks like that's the thing attracting the Iridescent Inscription. We need to get over there and have a look..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
