    {
      "subId": "7500402",
      "subQuestName": "Check the hole below",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750040201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750040201": {
            "id": "750040201",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "*hiss* Ugh— Aaah— I told you— It's dangerous, g—get out of here—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040202"
            ]
          },
          "750040202": {
            "id": "750040202",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Calamity— the seal— torn apart—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040203"
            ]
          },
          "750040203": {
            "id": "750040203",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Hroo... Rowrr...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040204"
            ]
          },
          "750040204": {
            "id": "750040204",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "That voice is more complete now, but... Somehow, it's not as frightening as before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040205"
            ]
          },
          "750040205": {
            "id": "750040205",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "My head still hurts a little, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040206"
            ]
          },
          "750040206": {
            "id": "750040206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#How you feeling, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040208",
              "750040210"
            ]
          },
          "750040208": {
            "id": "750040208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's good...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040211"
            ]
          },
          "750040211": {
            "id": "750040211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Anyway! How are you feeling, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040212"
            ]
          },
          "750040212": {
            "id": "750040212",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Mmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040213"
            ]
          },
          "750040213": {
            "id": "750040213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, looks like you're fine, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040214"
            ]
          },
          "750040214": {
            "id": "750040214",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Now that we're here, it's clear that the voices we heard coming from the stone pillar must've been...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040215"
            ]
          },
          "750040215": {
            "id": "750040215",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Those of the Khaenri'ahn soldiers who've been sealed here too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040216"
            ]
          },
          "750040216": {
            "id": "750040216",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrooh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040217"
            ]
          },
          "750040217": {
            "id": "750040217",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That means they were sealed in for many years, alongside the Abyss... But what's gone wrong here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040218"
            ]
          },
          "750040218": {
            "id": "750040218",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I think... The problem here is similar to the one we encountered with the Lesser Shadow Pins above. The surging Abyss has caused the Iridescent Inscription's power to shatter and be squeezed out of that giant sealing pillar...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040219"
            ]
          },
          "750040219": {
            "id": "750040219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That means we'll need to find the large Inscription's fragments and find a way to put this \"eggshell\" back together again, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040220"
            ]
          },
          "750040220": {
            "id": "750040220",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Indeed. That way, the seal can be fully restored, and the Abyss will stay sealed in this place. Then... Everything will likely go back to normal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040221"
            ]
          },
          "750040221": {
            "id": "750040221",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "But as with the Lesser Shadow Pins, the solid phlogiston surface will have an intense adversarial reaction to the Abyss, which is why the ground undulates so...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040222"
            ]
          },
          "750040222": {
            "id": "750040222",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "We must be careful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040223"
            ]
          },
          "750040223": {
            "id": "750040223",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Where are we gonna find said fragments, though?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040224"
            ]
          },
          "750040224": {
            "id": "750040224",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr... Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040225"
            ]
          },
          "750040225": {
            "id": "750040225",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Huh? Can you sense the Inscription's power hidden inside that thing, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}? You sure do have a pretty sharp nose... Wait, you were using your nose, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040226"
            ]
          },
          "750040226": {
            "id": "750040226",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, was that stone even there before?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040227"
            ]
          },
          "750040227": {
            "id": "750040227",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "#Did it... just appear as you approached the large Inscription, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040228"
            ]
          },
          "750040228": {
            "id": "750040228",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040229"
            ]
          },
          "750040229": {
            "id": "750040229",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, whatever. Let's take a look around that rock first, shall we?"
          },
          "750040210": {
            "id": "750040210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? That's not what Paimon was asking at all!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500403",
