      "subQuestName": "Unseal the inscription",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750040301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750040301": {
            "id": "750040301",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Just touch it once more and let the power of the phlogiston flow fully through the Inscription. That way, the \"eggshell\" should seal up completely... preventing the Abyss from escaping.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040302"
            ]
          },
          "750040302": {
            "id": "750040302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, that should solve our problem...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040303"
            ]
          },
          "750040303": {
            "id": "750040303",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Hmm... Let me try...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040304"
            ]
          },
          "750040304": {
            "id": "750040304",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Quick, quick! Seal us inside too— Just as we agreed—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040305"
            ]
          },
          "750040305": {
            "id": "750040305",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "*hiss*— Then leave. Get out of here— Why aren't you leaving— The calamity—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040306"
            ]
          },
          "750040306": {
            "id": "750040306",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Listen! There are more voices — more than those two soldiers, for sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040307"
            ]
          },
          "750040307": {
            "id": "750040307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Behind the glowing inscriptions, from a place further still than the anguished howls...\\nYou hear wrathful roars, and the pained whimpering of Saurians.\\nYou hear the sound of inchoate flesh and blood merging, the sick, giant, sticky, approaching footfalls of some giant thing beyond description.\\nBut you also hear something like thousands of hands, thousands constantly resisting, pushing outward...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040308"
            ]
          },
          "750040308": {
            "id": "750040308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You hear the endless battle in the narrow darkness.\\nIt is... torment unto eternity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040311"
            ]
          },
          "750040311": {
            "id": "750040311",
            "speakerId": 21557,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040312"
            ]
          },
          "750040312": {
            "id": "750040312",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Those heroes are still locked in battle to this day, preventing the Abyss from flooding out from the Iridescent Inscription.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040313"
            ]
          },
          "750040313": {
            "id": "750040313",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "The stories I tell have purpose. We must always remember those brave warriors and their sacrifices.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040314"
            ]
          },
          "750040314": {
            "id": "750040314",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "And yet... Such suffering. \"Though the heroes were wounded, they shook it off, and stood up, nothing hurt withal.\" That is what the stories say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040315"
            ]
          },
          "750040315": {
            "id": "750040315",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "But real wounds cannot be so easily shaken, nor true torment so easily conquered... There they have suffered so long, in that tiny, lightless world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040316"
            ]
          },
          "750040316": {
            "id": "750040316",
            "speakerId": 21557,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Hroo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040317"
            ]
          },
          "750040317": {
            "id": "750040317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Isn't there... anything we can do for them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040318"
            ]
          },
          "750040318": {
            "id": "750040318",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I want to as well, but the Abyss...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040319"
            ]
          },
          "750040319": {
            "id": "750040319",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Perhaps the only thing we can do is inherit their will and reseal the Inscription. Nor has this been the first time the Shadow Pin has fallen — in our tribe's tales, anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040320"
            ]
          },
          "750040320": {
            "id": "750040320",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Someone must have been here before, and someone must have read Traore's tablet. Those who came before to restore the Inscription must have seen what we saw.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040321"
            ]
          },
          "750040321": {
            "id": "750040321",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "And yet... Our stories did not change, for the warnings they gave were real, as were the dangers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040322"
            ]
          },
          "750040322": {
            "id": "750040322",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "All we can do is restore the Inscription and leave. To remember always, and never forget all that we have witnessed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040323"
            ]
          },
          "750040323": {
            "id": "750040323",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still... Ugh. They're supposed to be heroes! But they've been left here to suffer forever...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040324"
            ]
          },
          "750040324": {
            "id": "750040324",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're right, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040325"
            ]
          },
          "750040325": {
            "id": "750040325",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is no end for heroes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040326"
            ]
          },
          "750040326": {
            "id": "750040326",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I know that. I wish to give them peace, too. But I don't have that power. I'm just... a storyteller.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040327"
            ]
          },
          "750040327": {
            "id": "750040327",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040328"
            ]
          },
          "750040328": {
            "id": "750040328",
            "speakerId": 21557,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrooh!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500419",
      "subQuestName": "Unseal the inscription",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500411",
      "subQuestName": "Grant the warriors peace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750041101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750041101": {
            "id": "750041101",
            "speakerId": 21676,
            "speakerName": "\"Irizar\"",
            "text": "\"Leave! Go... I don't want him to see me— like this—\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750041102"
            ]
          },
          "750041102": {
            "id": "750041102",
            "speakerId": 21676,
            "speakerName": "\"Irizar\"",
            "text": "(The voice seems to come from the very depths of the unmoving statue. There is a hint of respect toward someone remaining within...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500412",
      "subQuestName": "Grant the warriors peace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500415",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the sealed pillar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750041501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750041501": {
            "id": "750041501",
            "speakerId": 6130,
            "speakerName": "Yukom",
            "text": "Uh, are you guys alright? What happened just now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750041502"
            ]
          },
          "750041502": {
            "id": "750041502",
            "speakerId": 6130,
            "speakerName": "Yukom",
            "text": "There was this sudden, massive earthquake! I was pretty worried, honestly, but it's good that you're alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750041503"
            ]
          },
          "750041503": {
            "id": "750041503",
            "speakerId": 6130,
            "speakerName": "Yukom",
            "text": "As for Titu... Why hasn't that guy come to take over this post yet? Ugh. I'd rather the earthquake flattened me at this point!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500413",
      "subQuestName": "Listen to the whispers of Night",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500414",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Titu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750040501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750040501": {
            "id": "750040501",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "#You're back! {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} and I were worried, honestly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040502"
            ]
          },
          "750040502": {
            "id": "750040502",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "But hah, what did I say, little fella? They're fine, see?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040503"
            ]
          },
          "750040503": {
            "id": "750040503",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Oooroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040504"
            ]
          },
          "750040504": {
            "id": "750040504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh. Not that we could explain where we went just now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040508",
              "750040507"
            ]
          },
          "750040508": {
            "id": "750040508",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "#In any case, thank you, {NICKNAME}. I never expected that the Abyss here could truly be purified.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040509"
            ]
          },
          "750040509": {
            "id": "750040509",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "The Iridescent Inscription, too, is gone — almost as if it no longer needed to stay. The tormented voices have also fallen silent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040510"
            ]
          },
          "750040510": {
            "id": "750040510",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "And that golden light! How it flowed like water, spreading across the ground.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040511"
            ]
          },
          "750040511": {
            "id": "750040511",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I even felt as if there were people within that light, waving at us...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040512"
            ]
          },
          "750040512": {
            "id": "750040512",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040513"
            ]
          },
          "750040513": {
            "id": "750040513",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Did you see them too, little one? And there was that light that surrounded you — and then you were gone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040514"
            ]
          },
          "750040514": {
            "id": "750040514",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. We didn't see anything, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040515"
            ]
          },
          "750040515": {
            "id": "750040515",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "#*sigh* Thank you so much once again, {NICKNAME}, Paimon. You too, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040516"
            ]
          },
          "750040516": {
            "id": "750040516",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "You truly are remarkable heroes. Thank you, on behalf of all those warriors who can finally know peace. Traore's final wishes have been fulfilled, and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040517"
            ]
          },
          "750040517": {
            "id": "750040517",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "As for those two Khaenri'ahn soldiers— no, Khaenri'ahn heroes! Now that the Abyss is no longer present, they need no longer serve as a warning to us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040518"
            ]
          },
          "750040518": {
            "id": "750040518",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I must pen a story about them, about how they helped save the Children of Echoes... In truth, I did have a flash of revelation as to what their thoughts must've been.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040519"
            ]
          },
          "750040519": {
            "id": "750040519",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "The Abyss represents such terrible peril that, were it up to me, I too might have made up some horror story to keep others from the tribe clear of this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040520"
            ]
          },
          "750040520": {
            "id": "750040520",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "*sigh* It seems almost funny how I was previously worried about having nothing to write. Now there's almost too much here — in our tale about a golden-haired outlander, a flying white fairy, a little Tepetlisaurus, and how they saved our tribe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040521"
            ]
          },
          "750040521": {
            "id": "750040521",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, that sounds like a pretty awesome synopsis already!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040522"
            ]
          },
          "750040522": {
            "id": "750040522",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Indeed. Stories pass on and stories change. Perhaps one day, a long, long time hence, even you might become as big as a mountain, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040523"
            ]
          },
          "750040523": {
            "id": "750040523",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Haargh! Behold, the mighty mountain, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040524"
            ]
          },
          "750040524": {
            "id": "750040524",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmph! Look ye, how she swallows a Sweet Madame the size of a Sumpter Beast in a single bite!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040525"
            ]
          },
          "750040525": {
            "id": "750040525",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr! Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040526"
            ]
          },
          "750040526": {
            "id": "750040526",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Haha, I doubt there'd be too many of those, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040527"
            ]
          },
          "750040527": {
            "id": "750040527",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "And as these stories pass down... I imagine that those two soldiers, too, will eventually become heroes. They might not have cared themselves, but I know that this is what I must do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040528"
            ]
          },
          "750040528": {
            "id": "750040528",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "#Once again, {NICKNAME}, Paimon, you have my utmost thanks... You too, of course, sharp little {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040529"
            ]
          },
          "750040529": {
            "id": "750040529",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040530"
            ]
          },
          "750040530": {
            "id": "750040530",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "As a storyteller, I swear to write for you the most exciting tale of adventure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040531"
            ]
          },
          "750040531": {
            "id": "750040531",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "Speaking of that— Oh, I should probably... head back to the sentry post to take up my shift.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040532"
            ]
          },
          "750040532": {
            "id": "750040532",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I'd almost forgotten about that amidst all the excitement...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040533"
            ]
          },
          "750040533": {
            "id": "750040533",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "...Ugh. I sure hope Yukom doesn't tear me a new one for being gone so long!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750040534"
            ]
          },
          "750040534": {
            "id": "750040534",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, uh, you should totally get back there pronto!"
          },
          "750040507": {
            "id": "750040507",
            "speakerId": 6131,
            "speakerName": "Titu",
            "text": "I—I see..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500410",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750041001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750041001": {
            "id": "750041001",
            "speakerId": 21677,
            "speakerName": "\"Zephaniah\"",
            "text": "\"Leave... Seal this place— as promised—\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750041002"
            ]
          },
          "750041002": {
            "id": "750041002",
            "speakerId": 21677,
            "speakerName": "\"Zephaniah\"",
            "text": "(That voice seems to come from the very depths of the unmoving statue. The rejection in those words are like two resolute hands that aim to push you from this place...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500499",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750049901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750049901": {
            "id": "750049901",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Come... over here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750049902"
            ]
          },
          "750049902": {
            "id": "750049902",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "You have brought so many slumberers, they who should have rested in peace..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}